  "paper": "paper_1a",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An object performs simple harmonic motion with frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span>. The distance between the extreme positions at which the object is at rest is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"b\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the speed of the object when it is halfway between its equilibrium position O and its extreme position?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{4}\\pi f b\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\\pi f b\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}\\pi f b\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\pi f b\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
